      "writtenOn": "2021-12-06T22:57:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My first thought also was that SongInfo should be pre-initialized.  But in java-land every single string would be initialized and highly probable to be overwritten, not very efficient.\n\nI agree there may be arbitrary ways this fix may not ideal and I\u0027m sure a better architected approach would be superior, but this band-aid seems to target a very specific compatibility use-case.\n\nLeveraging an imperfect partial fix today seems preferable then an unwritten ideal future fix guaranteed to cover all possible scenarios.",
